item.description:
&lt;!-- wp:paragraph --&gt;
I completely agree that our task is not to seek solutions but to more fully understand our predicament, our complicity in unsustainable/ collapsing societal, institutional and ecological conditions - many of which originated as &quot;solutions&quot; to a perceived problem. &quot;Everything is awesome&quot;  leaves the door open to thought formations that those of us who critique the seducttive certainties of fascism are somehow enemies, standing in the way of progress - and must be crushed. 
&lt;!-- /wp:paragraph --&gt;

